{"id": "68323", "title": "满世妖娆", "author": "楚离", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68323.htm", "intro": "耽美-穿越 \r\n\r\n商未离，只是一个为父抵债的牛郎，看遍了人事的冷暖， \r\n原本心如死灰的心却被温林蔚然给点燃， \r\n以为幸福就这样降临的时候，却被阻止， \r\n被制造了一起车祸……穿越了…… \r\n只想平平淡淡的过完这多出来的日子， \r\n可却闯入一个个性格迥异的美男， \r\n这与他的初衷完全不符，他该如何是好", "base": "files/article/html/68/68323", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10525186.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10525187.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10525188.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10525189.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10525190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10525191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10525192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10525193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10525194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10525195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55完结", "file": "10525196.html", "available": false}]}